    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "<b>MOVEMENT:</b>\n  \u2022 <b>W, A, S, D</b> - Walk Forward, Left, Back,
    Right\n  \u2022 <b>LEFT SHIFT</b> - Sprint / Dash\n  \u2022 <b>SPACEBAR</b> -
    Jump over chasms and hazards\n  \u2022 <b>MOUSE</b> - Orbit and aim Third-Person
    Camera\n  \u2022 <b>E KEY</b> - Interact with Doors and the Treasure Chest\n 
    \u2022 <b>ESCAPE</b> - Pause Game\n\n<b>HAZARD SURVIVAL GUIDE:</b>\n  1. <i>Collapsing
    Bridge:</i> Stones shake and fall after step. Run fast!\n  2. <i>Falling Rocks:</i>
    Watch for the red ground circle and dodge.\n  3. <i>Pressure Plates:</i> Notice
    raised floor tiles and jump over.\n  4. <i>Swinging Stone:</i> Time the pendulum
    swing and sprint across."
